  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reasons for Refusal \r\n\r\n1.\tThe proposed extension, incorporating a one-bedroom self contained unit, by virtue of its size, scale, design, appearance and excessive width, would be an overly dominant addition that would unbalance the existing semi-detached pair, which would be detrimental to the appearance of the subject property and the character of the street scene.  It would be an over development of the property and is therefore contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), H.4.1 (Housing standards and Guidelines) and H.6.3 (Backland Development/Infill Development) of The London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003 and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines.\r\n"
